# Prettier formats the config and the data here, and nothing else.
#
# The pages are Eleventy templates: fragments that a layout indents, not whole
# documents. Prettier would re-indent each one from column zero, which is right
# for a document and wrong for a fragment, so the templates keep their
# indentation by hand and the layout keeps its own.
*.html
*.njk

# Generated, vendored, or written to a house style prettier would flatten.
dist/
node_modules/
preview/
public/
src/scss/
src/js/
package-lock.json
.claude/
*.md
